{%- comment -%}
  Thin wrapper so the drawer in snippets/cart-drawer.liquid can be re-rendered on the
  server by the Section Rendering API (?sections=cart-drawer, or the `sections`
  parameter on /cart/add.js and /cart/change.js). That is what keeps every price in
  the drawer on the theme's money filter and the free-delivery progress on
  {% render 'free-shipping-bar' %} instead of re-implementing either in JavaScript.
  Rendered on every page from layout/theme.liquid. No settings: nothing here is meant
  to be edited in the theme editor.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'cart-drawer' %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart drawer",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
